# Architecture boundaries (scripts/check-architecture.sh).
# Format: <name>|<paths>|<extended regex>|<message>
# Adjust the paths to the project layout; a missing path is skipped.

# Configuration has one entry point; transport and domain code receive it.
env outside config|src/routes src/api src/controllers src/domain src/services|process\.env|Read configuration in the config module and inject it.
# Persistence goes through the data layer, never a hand-built client in handlers.
raw database client in handlers|src/routes src/api src/controllers|new[[:space:]]+(Pool|Client)[[:space:]]*\(|from[[:space:]]+['"](pg|mysql2|mongodb)['"]|Use the repository/data layer.
# Debug leftovers.
debugger statement|src|^[[:space:]]*debugger;?[[:space:]]*$|Remove debugger statements.
